# ColdEasy

Read `/docs` before building features. The specs are `00-index.md`, `01-prd.md`, `02-technical-requirements.md`, and `04-ui-ux-design-brief.md`.

## Stack

Vite, React, and TypeScript. npm. Tailwind CSS v4 through `@tailwindcss/vite`. Hash routing lives in `src/App.tsx`.

## Folders

- `src/pages` — one screen per route
- `src/components` — shared UI
- `src/context` — cart, language, theme
- `src/data` — product and copy data
- `src/lib` — tracking and WhatsApp helpers
- `public` — images and video

## Secrets

Never hardcode secrets. Keep keys in `.env.local`. Do not give a secret a `VITE_` name. A `VITE_` name is copied into the client bundle.

## Claims

No invented stats or claims. Ratings, review counts, impact figures, commissions, prices, and lab results must come from the client spec. Leave a TODO when a number is missing.

## Brand

Colours and fonts below are the tokens in `src/index.css`. The design brief in `/docs` wins if it disagrees.

- Ink `#251A10`, cream `#FCFBF1`, sand `#F5F3EC`
- Sky `#4FB8CC`, leaf `#487537`, olive `#9FA738`, marigold `#F0A023`, chilli `#EC2727`
- Headings: Montserrat. Body: Poppins. Hindi: Noto Sans Devanagari.
